OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue across Norfolk and Suffolk
OL,7,Fovernight, but elsewhere it will
OL,8,Fremain mainly dry with plenty of clear
OL,9,Fspells. Turning chilly, particularly
OL,10,Finland. Breezy at times, especially
OL,11,Ftowards the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FDry at first in the west
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells. Coastal showers
OL,15,Fwill gradually spread further inland
OL,16,Fthrough the day, with cloud increasing
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon. Breezy
OL,18,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
